  "description": "Vehicle image classification from a camera snapshot, in process, on CPU: a small image classifier (MobileNetV3, ONNX) tells an emergency vehicle (ambulance) from any other vehicle at a parking barrier. The crop of the vehicle comes from its plate box or from a fixed lane region. The model is shipped inside the package - no download, no Python, no service, works offline on x64 and arm64 (Linux, Windows).",
